    {
      "subId": "100915",
      "subQuestName": "Search for Cloud Retainer",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "10091501"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "10091501": {
            "id": "10091501",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Hey, who put this table here? They've even set it ready for dinner, there's a wine jug and everything...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "10091502"
            ]
          },
          "10091502": {
            "id": "10091502",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Ooh, they even have the guests' names carved into the seats! \"Here sits Retainer...\"",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "10091510"
            ]
          },
          "10091510": {
            "id": "10091510",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "\"Here sits Guizhong...\" \"Here sits Rex...\"",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "10091503"
            ]
          },
          "10091503": {
            "id": "10091503",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Maybe \"Rex\" is short for \"Rex Lapis\"? But Paimon has no idea about \"Guizhong.\"",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "10091504"
            ]
          },
          "10091504": {
            "id": "10091504",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "As for \"Retainer,\" hmm... That's it! When Moon Carver was going through the names of his adepti buddies, he said there was one called \"Cloud Retainer.\"",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "10091505"
            ]
          },
          "10091505": {
            "id": "10091505",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "So, this must be where Cloud Retainer and the other adepti have their dinner parties!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "10091506"
            ]
          },
          "10091506": {
            "id": "10091506",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Hehe, how about we cook up some extra-special dishes for the adepti? We're sure to get Cloud Retainer's attention that way!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "10091507"
            ]
          },
          "10091507": {
            "id": "10091507",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "But... What do adepti even eat, anyway? Paimon has no idea...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "10091508"
            ]
          },
          "10091508": {
            "id": "10091508",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Hmm, people must make offerings here all the time. Guess all we can do is look around the area for any leftovers, maybe that'll give us some ideas.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "10091509"
            ]
          },
          "10091509": {
            "id": "10091509",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Um, do you think maybe it's at all possible that the adepti might like to try some... Sticky Honey Roast?"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "100902",
      "subQuestName": "Look for traces of food offerings",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "10090201"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "10090201": {
            "id": "10090201",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Someone has definitely cooked here before. D'you think they were making an offering?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "10090202"
            ]
          },
          "10090202": {
            "id": "10090202",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Looks like they didn't use all the ingredients. Let's see here... we got some Snapdragon, some Lotus Heads, some Tofu... Whatever they were cooking, it sounds complicated!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "10090203"
            ]
          },
          "10090203": {
            "id": "10090203",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Hey, look over there... They left some notes, too.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "10090204"
            ]
          },
          "10090204": {
            "id": "10090204",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Yep, it's a doozy! Paimon's not surprised they had to write it all down, it's a lot to remember... We should read it carefully."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "100903",
      "subQuestName": "Look for traces of food offerings",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "10090301"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "10090301": {
            "id": "10090301",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Whoa... The ground is covered in flour. Tsk... What a messy chef...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "10090302"
            ]
          },
          "10090302": {
            "id": "10090302",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Hmm, seems there's meat in this pot, but Paimon can't tell which kind.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "10090303"
            ]
          },
          "10090303": {
            "id": "10090303",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Do you think whoever cooked this made it as an offering to the adepti?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "10090304"
            ]
          },
          "10090304": {
            "id": "10090304",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Hmm... Paimon can't quite imagine an offering made of flour and meat...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "10090305"
            ]
          },
          "10090305": {
            "id": "10090305",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Huh? Our messy chef dropped a piece of paper on the floor... Ew, and there's a huge footprint on it too...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "10090306"
            ]
          },
          "10090306": {
            "id": "10090306",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "But footprint aside, maybe it has something to do with this mystery dish?"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "100904",
      "subQuestName": "Look for traces of food offerings",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "10090401"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "10090401": {
            "id": "10090401",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "It's very clean here. Whoever cooked here last obviously likes to keep things neat and tidy...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "10090402"
            ]
          },
          "10090402": {
            "id": "10090402",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Paimon bets they were making an offering to the adepti...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "10090403"
            ]
          },
          "10090403": {
            "id": "10090403",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Looks like we got us some Matsutake and some Raw Meat...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "10090404"
            ]
          },
          "10090404": {
            "id": "10090404",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "And what do you know, the recipe is right here. This chef was a super organized person..."
          }
        }
      }
    },
